A Guide to Autonomy
===================

A learning book about personal and digital autonomy, privacy and money.
Original work: written for PROOF, an initiative of Cypher Baltics, for the
first PROOF conference (Vilnius, 2026), and carried as a community project by
Cypher Baltics. Original publication: https://proofconference.com/book/en/
This repository is the shared base that any community can fork, adapt and
publish as its own edition. An edition built from it may differ from the
original in its name, look, configuration, text and code.

